# A server that never sends 001 is hung up on 240 s after the socket
# opened. Lines arriving meanwhile do not extend the deadline.
! connect
> dial #1 irc.test:6667 plain
? notice Connecting to irc.test:6667
@ +10s
! opened
> CAP LS 302
> NICK textual
> USER textual 0 * Textual
@ +100s
< :irc.test NOTICE * :*** Looking up your hostname...
@ +139.999s
? registering
@ +1ms
> hangup #1
? notice Disconnected: registration timed out; reconnecting in 5 s
? waiting 4.965s
